  "has spxphot's 19 columns with the IRSA table's names (label, ra, dec, lambda, lambda_width, flux, flux_err, flux_err_tractor, flags, fit_ql, flux_bkg, lvf_id, det_id, deep_flg, mjd, data_collection, x_image, y_image, n_pix). The": "IRSA cədvəlinin adları ilə spxphot-un 19 sütununu ehtiva edir (label, ra, dec, lambda, lambda_width, flux, flux_err, flux_err_tractor, flags, fit_ql, flux_bkg, lvf_id, det_id, deep_flg, mjd, data_collection, x_image, y_image, n_pix).",
